panora (1.3.0) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Debian source package (PKG-03): dpkg-buildpackage now produces the
    same package packaging/build-deb.sh does, buildable with the standard
    Debian tooling (sbuild, pbuilder, a plain `dpkg-buildpackage -b`)
    instead of only the hand-rolled script. Full release notes for every
    version: https://github.com/ygkali/panora/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md

